---
layout: "base.njk"
title: "Journal | Greenverse Digital"
fullTitle: true
description: "Notes, essays, and observations on sustainable branding, conscious marketing, and editorial storytelling."
permalink: "/blog/"
---
{% from "journal-card.njk" import storyCard %}
<section class="journal-intro container container--wide">
  <div class="journal-intro__heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">The Greenverse journal</p>
    <h1>Ideas with<br><em>roots.</em></h1>
  </div>
  <div class="journal-intro__note">
    <p>Good stories grow something.</p>
    <p>Essays, observations, and field notes on building brands the planet can stand behind.</p>
    <a class="journal-intro__jump" href="#stories">Explore the stories <span aria-hidden="true">&#8595;</span></a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="journal-stories container container--wide" id="stories" aria-labelledby="stories-heading">
  <div class="journal-section-label">
    <h2 class="eyebrow" id="stories-heading">Stories to spend time with</h2>
    <span class="t-meta">{{ collections.posts | length }} published {% if collections.posts | length == 1 %}story{% else %}stories{% endif %}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="journal-stories__stack">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
      {{ storyCard(post, loop.index, loop.first) }}
    {% else %}
      <p>Our next story is taking root. Come back soon.</p>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="journal-archive t-meta">
    More from the early days:
    <a href="https://greenversedigital.blogspot.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">visit our Blogspot archive <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>.
  </p>
</section>
<section class="section"><div class="container">{% include "cta-banner.njk" %}</div></section>
